@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@directorToken = replace-with-director-jwt

### Filtered, paginated security and data-change events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AuditLog/events?page=1&pageSize=50&eventType=DataChange
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}

### Search events by actor, route, or entity
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AuditLog/events?page=1&pageSize=50&search=Room&fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}

### Overdue key returns
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AuditLog/overdue-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}

### Weekly key traffic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AuditLog/traffic?period=weekly
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}

### Daily room utilization (reservation count and booked hours)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AuditLog/room-utilization?period=daily
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}
